{"id":2664,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>冬至阳生，岁回律转；研途逐梦，暖意同行。在冬至佳节与硕士研究生招生考试交汇的特殊时刻，为传承中华优秀传统文化，缓解考研学子备考压力，传递学院的深切关怀与殷切期许。12月21日，经济与管理学院在麦港餐厅举办“‘饺’好运，一战成‘硕’”主题暖心活动，为全院考研学子送上热气腾腾的冬至饺子盛宴。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnlQt7L7rkM7liUj4Gsoz-aU462M4fwRozv4MmC4Ul-iL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2U1h7USy4UzNsMRCso7-Dnm-Dnm-8MRVVLR7PUl-sLlVFLmWVUm6kMRVFMRnknlLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PLmLbgtA8pUXcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4FBDA3A974678B6F26F2441E011AB71A/22EB7B41/44BEC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMNUt4Lm7iLzNDnjRLaMl78o7-4nRCwsLmLbL77snzlinzG0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4MYh2USyaM7UbM4ARMm9sL4Cbo7Uinm78LmWfn7-aUmAFMmLZLzWVnmVFUmvYnmUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PLmLbgtA8pUXcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.png\"></p><p>活动现场暖意融融，驱散了冬日的严寒。热情的餐厅阿姨为学子盛上饺子，冬至吃饺，暖身更暖心。一个个饺子就像‘定胜符’，一碗碗饺子整齐排列，每道褶痕都藏着“包裹好运”的寓意。“备考如资源配置，既要聚焦知识点‘精准投入’，也要兼顾身心健康‘长线投资’。这顿饺子是能量补给，更是信心加持，愿大家带着这份温暖轻装上阵。”</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TL8Ut4U4WfnzlsUjNW2L7lZUlWVLRQwkLmC4Lz74U4-DLlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybU1yDoSyZollsMR6VoznRnz98nmvZnNlZU4N8M498nNQFMRvbMznkM8VFMzvPL77Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PLmLbgtA8pUXcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/19B6989E747E94CE84F78FE8C94784FF/47954B7A/5710A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TUNWtRnRNaM8n7oj7Q2MmUanzn7UzvwPnRv8nzrRMR67MNC0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2LYyaMky4oz-ZUmW2LN7bMNU4Lz98o77aMl-aU4MkMNQFnlMRM4NsLmTFUmLaL8UJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PLmLbgtA8pUXcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.png\"></p><p>“在冬至这个特殊的日子里，能吃到学院精心准备的饺子，收到这么多温暖的祝福，感觉特别暖心、特别有力量。”一位考研学子感动地说，“这份温暖让我知道，我不是一个人在战斗，学院永远是我们最坚实的后盾。接下来我会带着这份鼓励全力以赴，争取不负期望，一战成硕。”</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TLmWtVM8CDLNQfMj8LDL8MRM4rVLm-w4ozCDLRGbL7C8LzL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfL1ybMkyDL4Csoz7Znl-8LmGiLl-inlU8Mm94L4VRnmVFL8MfolW7nRfFozW7M49Jqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PLmLbgtA8pUXcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4A2946367918EB42051B5ED468331CF1/3CA9BDD0/92D78\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMRntVo7nRo7-DMj4fVU8MfLmGYL7Cw8LzC4oRQVUmf7nz70gihFp2hmCIa0oShRMYhfnShfLmAkU4WknzAfM8U4M47ZUmMRnmCiU4-iolMFoR94MRUsMRfFnRvPLR6kgtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYLz-4oSbw62X8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次冬至暖心活动，以传统节日为载体，将文化传承与人文关怀深度融合，不仅让考研学子在寒冬中感受到了浓浓的温情，缓解了备考压力，更凝聚了学院的向心力与凝聚力。中北大学经济与管理学院始终秉持以人为本的育人理念，聚焦学子成长需求，通过开展各类接地气、有温度、有内涵的活动，为学子们的成长成才保驾护航。相信带着这份温暖与力量，考研学子们定能在考场上从容落笔、不负韶华，书写属于自己的逐梦华章。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnlQt7L7rkM7liUj4Gsoz-aU462M4fwRozv4MmC4Ul-iL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2U1h7USy4UzNsMRCso7-Dnm-Dnm-8MRVVLR7PUl-sLlVFLmWVUm6kMRVFMRnknlLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PLmLbgtA8pUXcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21239&e=.png"}